-based SAR filing decision&#10;review=needs_review, nodes=10, edges=11" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="150" width="1050" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_5d67e072b2" value="review_notes:&#10;Card assembles a decision process from fragmented statements across the section. The explicit sequence only covers the positive path; negative branches are logically inferred and supported by examples of reasons for not filing (insufficient evidence, legal orders without enough support). The PRECEDES edge from examine facts to analyze facts is inferred as a logical next step in the risk-based decision process." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="150" width="900" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_3a1fa61af9" value="trigger&#10;Detection of unusual activity&#10;v7u_N003576, v7u_N003577" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="300" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_4b9ec89e57" value="action&#10;Examine case facts&#10;v7u_N003577" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="300" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_dc6f201dbb" value="action&#10;Analyze facts and compare with regulatory guidelines&#10;v7u_N003583" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="300" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_62f095675a" value="standard&#10;Regulatory guidelines&#10;v7u_N003583" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="670" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_258dec16a1" value="decision&#10;Does analysis reveal suspicious activity?&#10;v7u_N003583" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="300" width="190" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_38d5e9a95e" value="decision&#10;Does it meet regulatory guidelines for filing a SAR?&#10;v7u_N003583" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="300" width="190" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_905a48f111" value="output&#10;Decision to file SAR&#10;v7u_N003583" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="440" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_17cf82cc99" value="output&#10;Decision to not file SAR&#10;v7u_N003583, v7u_N003579" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="440" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_ac68cc0360" value="action&#10;Document findings and rationale for decision&#10;v7u_N003579, v7u_N003583" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="440" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v_625008c86f" value="output&#10;Documented SAR decision rationale&#10;v7u_N003579, v7u_N003583" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="440" width="220" height="85" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e_352be1feb3" value="PRECEDES" style="endArrow=block